Dependencies:
 SDL3 (>= 3.4, for its built-in PNG loader)
 SDL3_mixer
 GLM (header-only, used for a few matrix operations)

On Ubuntu/Debian you can get all necessary packages by typing:
 sudo apt-get install g++ make pkg-config libsdl3-dev libsdl3-mixer-dev libglm-dev

If your distro doesn't package libsdl3-mixer-dev yet, the Makefile degrades
gracefully and builds without audio; everything else still works.

The Makefile lives at build/linux/Makefile; the top-level Makefile is a symlink
to it. From the top directory (the one with 'sources') you can 'make' and
'make install'.
